                    <h3 style="font-size:1.05rem; color:var(--text-head); margin-bottom:0.4rem;">Is Dezerv worth it for Indian investors?</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm">Dezerv suits HNI investors (₹10L+) who prefer professional management over self-managing. For investors with smaller portfolios or who want full transparency and control, Arthavi's free analytics toolset is a better fit.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item" style="margin-bottom:1.25rem;">
                    <h3 style="font-size:1.05rem; color:var(--text-head); margin-bottom:0.4rem;">Can I track my Dezerv portfolio in Arthavi?</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm">Yes. Dezerv invests through mutual funds registered with CAMS/KFintech. Download your CAS and import it into Arthavi — your Dezerv holdings appear automatically alongside all other investments.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item" style="margin-bottom:1.25rem;">
